[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-08): `gpaste-dev`'s closure from v3.23 installed, `efs-utils` and
`gpaste-dev` at a later version asked. `efs-utils` needs `python3~3.14`,
and the installed `xcb-proto`, needed through the installed chain under
`gpaste-dev`, needs `python3~3.12`; apk upgrades `python3`, and
`xcb-proto` to the build that states no version of `python3`.
`python3~3.14` is required through `py3-botocore`, the single candidate
of a name `efs-utils` needs, before either is installed
(`installed/a-sole-candidate-s-constraint-upgrades-an-installed-package`).

